 &lt;summary&gt;
 &lt;span class="catalogus-boom-leaf-title"&gt;Alleluia 9a Toon 1 (Groningen)&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;code class="catalogus-id"&gt;alleluia/9a-toon-1/groningen&lt;/code&gt;
 &lt;/summary&gt;
